{"src":"en","tgt":"tr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"tr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7705.7154709999995,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":9083.577647,"text":"Eğer National Treasure filmini izlediyseniz, Bağımsızlık Bildirgesi’nin arkasına bir hazine haritası yazıldığını düşünebilirsiniz."},{"kind":"audio","t":9260.370149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9265.486008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9270.44665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9275.722706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9281.135041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9286.271429,"samples":31764,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":13870.872299,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14978.353034,"text":"Sıcak çikolata Belçika standartlarına uygun. Meyve suları pahalıdır, ancak bir süre sonra tatlılığını hissedebileceksiniz."},{"kind":"audio","t":15066.738465000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15068.578615999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15069.006049,"samples":3845,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"audio","t":15098.843957000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":15100.090367,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15101.728442,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15102.316962,"samples":15938,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":22208.549008,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23205.527922,"text":"Ancak bu doğru değil. Belgenin arka yüzünde bir şeyler yazılı olsa da bu bir hazine haritası değildir."},{"kind":"audio","t":23279.144617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23279.439172000002,"samples":3733,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"audio","t":23322.176896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23327.500181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23333.092713000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23335.017002,"samples":14266,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":29976.71106,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31766.93874,"text":"Kendi ülkenizin dışındaki hükümetlerin tavsiyelerine de başvurmak isteyebilirsiniz, ancak onların tavsiyeleri kendi vatandaşları için hazırlanmıştır."},{"kind":"audio","t":31946.295711000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31951.502769000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31957.848859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31962.211890000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31967.486846000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31972.92259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31976.790319000003,"samples":27975,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":41279.761351999994,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42472.128812999996,"text":"Hong Kong Adası, Hong Kong bölgesine adını vermiştir ve birçok turist tarafından en önemli ziyaret yeri olarak görülür."},{"kind":"audio","t":42616.337381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42621.164984999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42626.421711999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42631.772607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42637.039804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42637.935639999996,"samples":10309,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":49090.375512,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50537.64412999999,"text":"Sıcak enlemlerde veya dağ geçitlerinde araç kullanacak herkes, kar, buz veya kaygan zemin olasılığını göz önünde bulundurmalıdır."},{"kind":"audio","t":50688.875136999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50693.947856,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50699.241052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":50704.529809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50710.077530999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50715.156391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":50715.462056,"samples":668,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":58776.629949999995,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59848.157183999996,"text":"Ayrışma ve yeniden birleşme, varyasyonları bu iki havuz arasında gidip gelmeye neden olur."},{"kind":"audio","t":59966.067297999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59971.285505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59976.545591999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59981.895876999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":59982.202002,"samples":1560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":61180.10576599999,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61417.931023,"text":"Her nesilde."},{"kind":"audio","t":61444.94100499999,"samples":25634,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":930},{"kind":"input","t":66501.68499400001,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67392.668064,"text":"Entomologlar, bu böcek grubu için resmi bir anlamda “bug” terimini kullanırlar."},{"kind":"audio","t":67488.681845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67490.003664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67491.663988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67492.42217600001,"samples":19003,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":74688.18978500001,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75788.70252,"text":"Öncelikle, çoğu binici topuklu ve pürüzsüz, oldukça dar tabanlı binek botları giyer."},{"kind":"audio","t":75905.322694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75910.84985700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75916.490907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75922.078289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75922.360684,"samples":1838,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":83906.282341,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":85032.279033,"text":"Bu komisyon, Ekim ayında başlayan yaygın rejim karşıtı protestolara Martelli’nin verdiği yanıttı."},{"kind":"audio","t":85159.433011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85164.44159100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85169.734287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85174.95255500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85175.92468000001,"samples":11034,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":91129.402728,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92055.05949900001,"text":"İtfaiye ekipleri gece 23.35 civarında yangını sonunda söndürdü."},{"kind":"audio","t":92153.812927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92158.999465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92164.464708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92167.623658,"samples":22068,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"input","t":97359.140524,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98312.229752,"text":"Atlantik kasırga sezonunun gergin fırtınası, Subtropikal Fırtına Jerry,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98412.706672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98417.79763100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98422.970189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98426.420045,"samples":23182,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":100224.095377,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100719.855372,"text":"Bugün Atlantik Okyanusu'nda oluştu."},{"kind":"audio","t":100772.14507500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100773.145999,"samples":28811,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"input","t":107228.60059300001,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":108264.622439,"text":"Bu durum, bizi araçları ve birçok başka ulaşım cihazını eğitmeye yöneltti."},{"kind":"audio","t":108368.406126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108373.883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108378.814382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":108379.55661,"samples":8972,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":116606.081938,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117789.377087,"text":"M.S. 400 yılı civarında başlayıp uzun süre devam eden lüksün merkezi olarak ünlüdür."},{"kind":"audio","t":117909.583214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117914.798611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117920.104837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117925.340154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117927.101206,"samples":14377,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":120737.924984,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121203.742117,"text":"M.S. 1100 yılına kadar."},{"kind":"audio","t":121257.95562800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121260.570937,"samples":20452,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":127058.582389,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127654.700639,"text":"Ayın yüzeyi kayalar ve tozdan oluşur. Ay'ın dış katmanına kabuk denir."},{"kind":"audio","t":127744.03634400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127748.196568,"samples":28811,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":127753.56160300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127756.062074,"samples":17944,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":134203.289765,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135705.15460100002,"text":"Amerika Birleşik Devletleri Mühendislik Kolordusu, altı inçlik yağışın daha önce hasar görmüş yapıları yıkabileceğini tahmin etti."},{"kind":"audio","t":135856.75543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":135861.84427,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135867.091917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135872.58887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135877.729758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135881.264162,"samples":24241,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":141176.358849,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142740.551528,"text":"Özellikle, bir kişinin yalan söyleyip söylemediğinin, mikro ifadelerin doğru şekilde yorumlanmasıyla anlaşılabileceği iddia edilmektedir."},{"kind":"audio","t":142923.375473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142928.60331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142934.130742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142939.727324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142945.381134,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142950.832738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142951.266721,"samples":6520,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":147229.81151600002,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":148088.598007,"text":"Yapının üzerine işaretler bırakarak veya grafiti çizerek siteye zarar vermeyin."},{"kind":"audio","t":148183.378876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148188.540594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148193.760411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148195.988866,"samples":16774,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":154862.941808,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156420.550771,"text":"Kaplanın kükremesi, aslanın güçlü kükremesine benzemez; daha çok öfkeli ve bağırılan kelimelerden oluşan bir cümleye benzer."},{"kind":"audio","t":156511.111047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156516.302115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156519.57778300002,"samples":23349,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":156544.642296,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156549.787954,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156556.032686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156556.435979,"samples":4792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":161904.212691,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":163583.577767,"text":"20. yüzyıl araştırmaları, gizli ve ifade edilen olmak üzere iki tür genetik çeşitlilik havuzunun bulunduğunu göstermiştir."},{"kind":"audio","t":163606.167999,"samples":14489,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":600},{"kind":"audio","t":163721.299416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163722.743893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163724.224609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163725.810664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163727.36202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163727.96751000002,"samples":15882,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"close","t":173807.735856,"code":1005}]}